Hire Board — Feature Reference
================================

A full-stack job portal built with Node.js/Express, React/Vite, and Supabase (PostgreSQL).

Two user roles: **Job Seeker** and **Recruiter**.
Total features: 104 across 12 categories.


━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
1. AUTHENTICATION & ACCOUNT
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

1.1  Register
     Create account with name, email, password, and role (Seeker / Recruiter).
     Passwords are bcrypt-hashed. Returns a JWT token (7-day expiry).
     Rate-limited: 10 requests/minute per IP.
     API:  POST /api/auth/register
     Page: /register

1.2  Login
     Sign in with email and password. Returns JWT + user object.
     Rate-limited: 10 requests/minute per IP.
     API:  POST /api/auth/login
     Page: /login

1.3  Session Restore
     On app load, if a JWT exists in localStorage, it fetches the current user
     and (for recruiters) the registered company. Stores everything in
     React Context so all components have access.
     API:  GET /api/auth/me
     File: context/AuthContext.jsx

1.4  Email Verification (OTP)
     After registration, a 6-digit OTP is generated and emailed via Resend.
     User enters OTP to verify their email. Required before applying to jobs
     or posting jobs.
     API:  POST /api/auth/verify-email
     Page: /verify-email

1.5  Resend OTP
     Regenerates and re-sends the verification code. Has a 10-minute cooldown
     between requests and a 2 OTPs/day limit.
     API:  POST /api/auth/resend-otp
     Page: /verify-email (button)

1.6  Forgot Password / Reset Password
     Static pages directing users to contact support for password recovery.
     Pages: /forgot-password, /reset-password

1.7  Logout
     Clears JWT from localStorage, resets all auth state, redirects to /login.
     Component: Navbar.jsx (avatar dropdown → "Sign out")

1.8  JWT Token System
     Tokens contain { id, name, email, role } with 7-day expiry.
     Sent via Authorization: Bearer <token> header on all authenticated requests.
     Verified by middleware/auth.js on every protected route.

1.9  Rate Limiting
     IP-based in-memory rate limiter with 1-minute sliding window.
     Applied to all auth routes (10 req/min). Sets Retry-After header on 429.
     File: middleware/rateLimit.js


