3. USER PROFILE — RECRUITER
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

3.1  Same Full Profile as Seeker
     Recruiters now have the exact same profile form as seekers:
     Photo, headline, location, phone, skills, experience, bio, LinkedIn,
     portfolio, education, work experience, certifications, languages,
     job preferences, and resume upload. Company name is auto-set from the
     registered company (shown as a clickable link in the company field).
     Skills and experience placeholders adapt to recruiter context.

3.2  View Applicant Profiles
     Recruiter can view the full profile of any seeker who applied to their
     jobs. Includes all sections: headline, skills, education, work experience,
     certifications, languages, job preferences, resume download.
     API:  GET /api/users/:id  (guarded: seeker must have applied to recruiter's job)
           GET /api/users/:id/resume
     Page: MyJobs.jsx → "View profile" button → modal


