8. TEAM MANAGEMENT
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

8.1  View Company Team
     Lists all shortlisted/accepted candidates across all jobs for a company,
     plus seekers whose "company" field matches. Shows avatar (or initial
     fallback), name, headline, location, skills, status badge, job title, bio.
     API:  GET /api/jobs/company/:companyId/team
     Pages: CompanyProfile.jsx, JobDetail.jsx

8.2  Remove Team Member
     Recruiter removes an accepted member (clears their company field).
     Only visible to the company owner.
     API:  DELETE /api/jobs/company/:companyId/team/:seekerId
     Page: CompanyProfile.jsx

8.3  Auto-Assign on Accept
     When status is set to "accepted", the seeker's company field is
     automatically set to the company name. They appear in the team section.
     This persists even if the job is later deleted (written to users.company).
     Server-side: updateUserCompany() during PATCH status.


