10. NOTIFICATIONS
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

10.1 Notification Bell
     "Alerts" link in navbar with red dot indicator when unread notifications
     exist. Clicking opens a dropdown panel.

10.2 Unread Count Polling
     Unread notification count polls every 15 seconds.
     API:  GET /api/notifications

10.3 Notification Dropdown
     Header with "Mark all read" button (if unread > 0).
     List of notifications with message text, timestamp, read/unread styling.
     Clicking a notification marks it as read and navigates to its link.

10.4 Mark Single Read
     API:  PATCH /api/notifications/:id/read

10.5 Mark All Read
     API:  PATCH /api/notifications/read-all

10.6 Notification Types
     - application:     New application received (recruiter)
     - application-status: Status change (seeker)
     - message:         New message received (both)

10.7 Notification Links
     Each notification has a link (e.g. /my-jobs, /applications, /messages)
     that the frontend navigates to on click.

10.8 Cleanup on Job Delete
     When a job is deleted, its associated application notifications are
     scoped to the recruiter and deleted.


