12. UI/UX & PLATFORM FEATURES
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

12.1  Landing Page
      Public marketing page with hero ("Know the company. Before you apply."),
      animated stats, 3 feature cards, "How it works" 3-step guide, CTA block.
      Only "Get started free" CTA (no "Browse jobs" button — requires login).
      Only shown to unauthenticated users; logged-in users redirect to /browse.
      Page: / (Landing.jsx + App.jsx LandingRedirect)

12.2  Responsive Navbar
      Brand link, role-conditional navigation links, notification bell,
      avatar dropdown. Hamburger menu for mobile. All menus close on route
      change. File: Navbar.jsx

12.3  Registered/Unregistered Badges
      Self-declared company status shown on job cards, company profiles,
      job detail pages, and browse companies. Defaults to Unregistered.

12.4  Toast Notifications
      Ephemeral messages (auto-dismiss after 2.6s) for success/error feedback.
      File: context/ToastContext.jsx

12.5  Modal System
      Reusable overlay pattern (click-outside-to-close). Used for apply form,
      delete confirmation, profile view, team member removal.
      CSS: modal-overlay, modal-box

12.6  Pagination
      Prev/Next with "Page X of Y" on BrowseJobs, BrowseCompanies.

12.7  Debounced Search
      250ms debounce on search inputs. Resets to page 1 on query change.

12.8  Onboarding Guard
      Redirects through required setup: verify email → register company
      (recruiter) → complete profile (headline + skills for seeker).
      File: OnboardingGuard.jsx

12.9  Role-Based Routing
      RequireRole component redirects unauthorized users to /login or /.
      File: App.jsx

12.10 Job Card Tags
      Simplified tag sets: job type (dark), salary range (dark).
      Removed mode, experience level, skills, and description from browse
      cards to reduce congestion.

12.11 Expiration Indicators
      "Applications closed" (red) for past-expiry jobs.
      "Closing soon" (amber) for jobs expiring within 3 days.

12.12 Empty States
      Contextual messages with action buttons: "No jobs found",
      "No companies found", "No applications yet", etc.

12.13 Error Handling & Retry
      "Something went wrong" states with "Try again" buttons.
      Server errors via toast or inline error text.

12.14 Loading States
      Button text changes: "Signing in...", "Saving...", "Submitting...", etc.

12.15 Tag Input Component
      Reusable: text input + "Add" button + tag chips with "×" remove.
      Supports comma separation and Enter key. Used for skills, tech stack,
      required skills.

12.16 Show More/Less
      Company descriptions truncated at 60px via CSS overflow with smooth
      transition. "Show more" button placed outside the truncated element.
      Fixed-height cards in BrowseCompanies directory.

12.17 Back Navigation
      "← Back" button on detail pages using navigate(-1).

12.18 Logo & Avatar Display
      Circular company logos and user avatars across the app.
      Classes: logo-sm (36px), logo-md (56px), logo-lg (64px), avatar-sm
      (36px), avatar-md (56px). Initial-letter fallback when no image.
      Shown on: BrowseJobs cards, MyJobs cards + applicant rows,
      BrowseCompanies cards, CompanyProfile team, JobDetail header,
      JobDetail "About the company" section, JobDetail team.

12.19 Social Links
      Clickable social media badges on company profiles.

12.20 Static 404 Page
      Catch-all route: "Lost?" eyebrow, "404" heading, home link.
      Page: NotFound.jsx

12.21 CORS & Helmet
      Configurable allowed origins (FRONTEND_URL env). Security headers via helmet.

12.22 JSON Body Limit
      Express body parser limited to 1 MB.

12.23 Input Sanitization
      All inputs: trimmed, length-capped, URLs auto-prefixed, arrays capped,
      byte sizes calculated. Functions: cleanString(), cleanUrl(), dataUrlBytes().


