API REFERENCE — ALL ENDPOINTS
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Authentication
  POST   /api/auth/register          Create account (rate-limited)
  POST   /api/auth/login             Sign in (rate-limited)
  GET    /api/auth/me                Get current user + company
  POST   /api/auth/verify-email      Verify email with OTP
  POST   /api/auth/resend-otp        Resend verification code

Users
  PUT    /api/users/me/profile       Update own profile (all fields)
  POST   /api/users/me/resume        Upload resume (base64)
  DELETE /api/users/me/resume        Remove resume
  GET    /api/users/:id              View seeker profile (guarded)
  GET    /api/users/:id/resume       Download seeker resume (guarded)

Companies
  GET    /api/companies              List companies (paginated, searchable)
  GET    /api/companies/mine         Get own company (recruiter)
  GET    /api/companies/:id          Get company profile + recent jobs
  POST   /api/companies              Register company (recruiter)
  PUT    /api/companies/:id          Update company (owner only)

Jobs
  GET    /api/jobs                   List jobs (paginated, searchable)
  GET    /api/jobs/mine              List recruiter's jobs
  GET    /api/jobs/mine/applied      Get applied job IDs (seeker)
  GET    /api/jobs/applications/mine Get own applications (seeker)
  GET    /api/jobs/company/:cid/team Get company team
  DELETE /api/jobs/company/:cid/team/:sid  Remove team member (owner)
  GET    /api/jobs/:id               Get job detail + company
  POST   /api/jobs                   Post new job (recruiter)
  PUT    /api/jobs/:id               Update job (owner)
  PATCH  /api/jobs/:id/toggle-active Toggle active/inactive (owner)
  DELETE /api/jobs/:id               Delete job + cascading data (owner)
  POST   /api/jobs/:id/apply         Apply to job (seeker)
  GET    /api/jobs/:id/applicants    View applicants (owner)
  PATCH  /api/jobs/:jid/applications/:aid  Update status (owner)

Messages
  GET    /api/messages/conversations  List conversations
  GET    /api/messages/thread         Open/create thread by job+person
  GET    /api/messages/:id            Get messages in conversation
  POST   /api/messages                Send message

Notifications
  GET    /api/notifications           List notifications + unread count
  PATCH  /api/notifications/:id/read  Mark single as read
  PATCH  /api/notifications/read-all  Mark all as read

System
  GET    /api/stats                   Platform statistics (public)
  GET    /api/health                  Health check


